<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - EDS started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - EDS started as hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said analyst Mark Wolfenberger started coverage of Electronic Data Systems Corp with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- said believes company's scale business model could be under increasing margin pressure over the next several years.</p>
<p>-- estimates fiscal 1997 earnings at $2.35 per share and 1998 earnings at $2.60 per share.</p>
<p>-- EDS shares were up 7/8 to 46-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
